<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-8 text-center">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">About CV Buildo</h1>
            <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">We help job seekers land their dream jobs by beating the ATS.</p>
            <p>CV Buildo was created with a simple mission: to provide free, high-quality, and ATS-friendly resume building tools to job seekers worldwide. Many premium services charge expensive monthly subscriptions for basic CV formatting. We believe everyone deserves a fair chance at a great career.</p>
            <p>Our platform offers a fully browser-based CV builder with 30+ professional templates, along with a smart ATS checker that analyzes your resume against specific job roles. Your data is never stored on our servers, ensuring 100% privacy.</p>
            <div class="mt-5">
                <h5 class="fw-bold">Contact Us</h5>
                <p>If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reach out to us at: <br> <strong>evermontllc2006@gmail.com</strong></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>